# Essential Environment Variables for Code Server AI

## AI Provider API Keys (Environment Level)

Set these in your Dokploy Environment Settings:

```bash
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-openrouter-api-key
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key
GITHUB_TOKEN=your-github-token
FREELLMAPI_API_KEY=your-freellmapi-api-key
```

## Encryption Key (Environment Level)

```bash
ENCRYPTION_KEY=generate-with-openssl-rand-hex-32
```

## RustFS Credentials (Environment Level)

```bash
RUSTFS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key
RUSTFS_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key
```

## Project-Level Configuration (Project Settings)

Set these in Dokploy Project Settings:

```bash
CS_PASSWORD=changeme
CODESERVER_VERSION=4.123.0
GITEA_VERSION=1.23.0
GITEA_DOMAIN=https://gitea.example.com
FREELLM_VERSION=latest
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your-postgres-password
RUSTFS_ENDPOINT=http://rustfs:9000
RUSTFS_BUCKET=code-server-backups
TZ=UTC
```

## Service-Level Configuration (Per-App Config)

Copy relevant sections below to each service's Configuration:

### Code Server Service

```bash
CS_DEFAULT_WORKSPACE=/workspace
CS_PASSWORD=${{project.CS_PASSWORD}}
CODESERVER_VERSION=${{project.CODESERVER_VERSION}}
TZ=${{project.TZ}}
```

### FreeLLMAPI Service

```bash
FREELLM_VERSION=${{project.FREELLM_VERSION}}
TZ=${{project.TZ}}
ENCRYPTION_KEY=${{environment.ENCRYPTION_KEY}}
```

### Gitea Service

```bash
GITEA_ADMIN_USER=admin
GITEA_ADMIN_PASSWORD=changeme
GITEA_ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@yourdomain.com
GITEA_VERSION=${{project.GITEA_VERSION}}
GITEA_DOMAIN=${{project.GITEA_DOMAIN}}
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=${{project.POSTGRES_PASSWORD}}
TZ=${{project.TZ}}
```

### RustFS Service

```bash
RUSTFS_ROOT_USER=admin
RUSTFS_ROOT_PASSWORD=changeme
RUSTFS_ENDPOINT=${{project.RUSTFS_ENDPOINT}}
RUSTFS_BUCKET=${{project.RUSTFS_BUCKET}}
RUSTFS_ACCESS_KEY=${{environment.RUSTFS_ACCESS_KEY}}
RUSTFS_SECRET_KEY=${{environment.RUSTFS_SECRET_KEY}}
```

## Variable Reference

| Variable | Level | Description |
|----------|-------|-------------|
| OPENROUTER_API_KEY | Environment | OpenRouter API key |
| ANTHROPIC_API_KEY | Environment | Anthropic API key |
| OPENAI_API_KEY | Environment | OpenAI API key |
| ENCRYPTION_KEY | Environment | 32-char hex for encryption |
| RUSTFS_ACCESS_KEY | Environment | RustFS access key |
| RUSTFS_SECRET_KEY | Environment | RustFS secret key |
| CS_PASSWORD | Project | Code Server admin password |
| CODESERVER_VERSION | Project | Code Server version |
| GITEA_VERSION | Project | Gitea version |
| GITEA_DOMAIN | Project | Gitea domain |
| POSTGRES_PASSWORD | Project | PostgreSQL password |
| FREELLM_VERSION | Project | FreeLLMAPI version |
